  "body": "With an open outlook and no houses directly across the road, this brand-new 206sqm home offers a wonderful lifestyle filled with space, sunshine, and natural light. High ceilings and a bright, airy interior create an immediate sense of openness, while the thoughtfully designed layout makes everyday family living both comfortable and effortless.\r\n\r\nHighlights include:\r\n\r\n• 5 bedrooms and 3 modern bathrooms, including a guest bedroom and full\r\nbathroom on the ground floor\r\n\r\n• Spacious master suite with a walk-in wardrobe, ensuite, and private balcony\r\noverlooking the peaceful reserve\r\n\r\n• Three additional upstairs bedrooms serviced by a stylish family bathroom\r\n\r\n• Light-filled open-plan living and dining area with seamless indoor-outdoor\r\nflow\r\n\r\n• Designer kitchen featuring quality appliances, premium finishes, and ample\r\nstorage\r\n\r\n• Sunny front deck, perfect for relaxing or entertaining family and friends\r\n\r\n• Second living area upstairs, ideal as a family retreat or children's lounge\r\n\r\n• 10-Year Master Build Guarantee for added peace of mind\r\n\r\nEnjoy the best of Millwater living, where everyday convenience meets a relaxed coastal lifestyle. With local schools, parks, cafés, Silverdale Shopping Centre, Orewa Beach, and motorway connections all just minutes away, everything you need is within easy reach. It's the perfect setting for families looking to enjoy both space and convenience.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
